{% schema %}
  {
    
    "name": "Section 2",
    "tag": "section",
    "class": "gps-593654836788986671 gps gpsil",
    "settings": [{"type":"paragraph","content":"Section design by GemPages. [Click here to start design](https://admin.shopify.com/store/bg1v1z-zg/apps/gempages-cro/app/shopify/edit?pageType=GP_STATIC&editorId=593654810297762607&sectionId=593654836788986671)"},{"type":"select","label":"Section Preload","id":"section_preload","options":[{"label":"On","value":"true"},{"label":"Off","value":"false"},{"label":"Off Lazy Script","value":"off_lazy_script"}],"default":"false"},{"type":"text","label":"Checksum","id":"checksum"},{"type":"html","id":"gg_jnW8l5X5_text","label":"gg_jnW8l5X5_text","default":"<p><strong>7 Reasons Why 93% of Thyroid Hair Loss Treatments Fail (And The One Solution That Actually Works)</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggImMaOKjTi_text","label":"ggImMaOKjTi_text","default":"<p><i>New research reveals why Rogaine, biotin, and even your doctor's prescriptions aren't stopping your hair from falling out in clumps – and the mineral breakthrough that's helping thousands restore their hair in 8-12 weeks</i>&nbsp;</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggPp4_CtBiX_text","label":"ggPp4_CtBiX_text","default":"By <strong>Dr. Margaret Anne</strong>"},{"type":"html","id":"gglr5gNNPty_text","label":"gglr5gNNPty_text","default":"<p>Last Updated Mar 3.2025</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggW6KT0qFRf_text","label":"ggW6KT0qFRf_text","default":"<p><strong>Summary:</strong> <i>If you're losing handfuls of hair in the shower despite \"normal\" thyroid tests...</i></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><i>If you've tried Rogaine, biotin, collagen, and every supplement that promises to stop the shedding...</i></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><i>If your doctor keeps telling you \"your TSH is fine\" while you watch your ponytail shrink to the width of a pencil...</i></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><i>Then what you're about to discover will change everything.</i></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><i>Because after analyzing 1,847 cases of thyroid-related hair loss and reviewing 23 clinical studies, we've identified exactly why traditional treatments fail – and more importantly, the precise mineral combination that's helping women see baby hairs sprouting in as little as 3 weeks.</i></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gggLW4jgL3W_text","label":"gggLW4jgL3W_text","default":"1. Your Body Is Creating \"Fake Keys\" That Lock Your Hair Follicles Shut"},{"type":"html","id":"ggj2kmbnq_-_text","label":"ggj2kmbnq_-_text","default":"<p>Here's what your doctor isn't explaining about thyroid hair loss...</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Your hair follicles are like tiny doors that need T3 (active thyroid hormone) to stay open and grow.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Think of T3 as the \"master key\" that unlocks healthy hair growth.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>But with hypothyroidism, something sinister happens:</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggRW_iN68BA_text","label":"ggRW_iN68BA_text","default":"<p><strong>The Reverse T3 Problem:</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Instead of converting T4 (inactive hormone) into T3 (the key your hair needs), your body creates Reverse T3 – a \"fake key\" that fits into your hair follicle receptors but doesn't actually work.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>These fake keys jam the locks, blocking real T3 from entering. Your follicles literally suffocate without the hormone they need to survive.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>This is why increasing your levothyroxine dose doesn't stop the shedding. You're creating more T4, but your body keeps making those useless fake keys instead of the real ones.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggwBnSIoNIg_text","label":"ggwBnSIoNIg_text","default":"2. Stress From Hair Loss Creates MORE Hair Loss (The Vicious Cycle Nobody Talks About)"},{"type":"html","id":"ggXcjld3Nx__text","label":"ggXcjld3Nx__text","default":"<p>Remember that panic you feel when you see clumps in the drain?&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The crying in the shower?&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The anxiety before washing your hair?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That stress is making everything worse.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggtnkBW_nmd_text","label":"ggtnkBW_nmd_text","default":"<p><strong>The Cortisol Connection:</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>High stress → High cortisol → More Reverse T3 production</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Every time you panic about hair loss, your body creates</p><p>MORE of those fake keys that block hair growth.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggqaZGTXA_2_text","label":"ggqaZGTXA_2_text","default":"3. You're Missing The THREE Critical Minerals That Control T4 to T3 Conversion"},{"type":"html","id":"gg5dSkQ3uSz_text","label":"gg5dSkQ3uSz_text","default":"<p>After reviewing 1,847 cases of thyroid hair loss, we discovered a shocking pattern:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>97% of women with thyroid hair loss are deficient in at least one of these minerals:</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg0PGCz2mI1_text","label":"gg0PGCz2mI1_text","default":"<p><strong>Selenium (200mcg):</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The \"conversion spark\" that turns T4 into active T3. Without enough selenium, your body defaults to making Reverse T3 instead. Studies show 1 billion people are selenium deficient – mostly in America.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Iodine (100mcg - balanced dose):</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Your thyroid literally cannot make hormones without iodine. But too much triggers flare-ups. This precise dose provides just enough fuel without overwhelming the system. 2 billion people worldwide are deficient.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Zinc (15mg):</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Makes your hair follicle receptors sensitive again. Even if you have T3, it's useless if the receptors can't recognize it. Zinc \"polishes\" the locks so the keys work properly.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(211,47,47);font-size:11px;\"><i><strong>⚠️ Taking these minerals separately can be dangerous. The ratio matters more than the amount</strong></i></span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(211,47,47);font-size:15px;\"><strong>.</strong></span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggXk3JYZs3L_text","label":"ggXk3JYZs3L_text","default":"<p>SALE ENDS SOON</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggJ9wtAiWFP_dayLabel","label":"ggJ9wtAiWFP_dayLabel","default":"Days"},{"type":"html","id":"ggJ9wtAiWFP_hourLabel","label":"ggJ9wtAiWFP_hourLabel","default":"hrs"},{"type":"html","id":"ggJ9wtAiWFP_minuteLabel","label":"ggJ9wtAiWFP_minuteLabel","default":"min"},{"type":"html","id":"ggJ9wtAiWFP_secondLabel","label":"ggJ9wtAiWFP_secondLabel","default":"sec"},{"type":"html","id":"ggJ9wtAiWFP_weekLabel","label":"ggJ9wtAiWFP_weekLabel","default":"Weeks"},{"type":"html","id":"ggFSc96f3xi_text","label":"ggFSc96f3xi_text","default":"<p>We only produce 5,000 bottles per month. With 4,726+ success stories spreading on social media, we sell out every 3 weeks. Next batch won't arrive for another 6-8 weeks.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg2t5f4dfBF_label","label":"gg2t5f4dfBF_label","default":"<p>CHECK AVAILIBILITY NOW 👉</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggVEAnsiX9o_text","label":"ggVEAnsiX9o_text","default":"<p>Sell-out Risk: <span style=\"color:#E30D0D;\"><strong>High</strong></span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggStiKq6yMT_text","label":"ggStiKq6yMT_text","default":"<p>|</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggyzMTEHkRf_text","label":"ggyzMTEHkRf_text","default":"<p><strong>FREE Gifts</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggIugrpED0F_text","label":"ggIugrpED0F_text","default":"<p>Try it today with a 30-Day Money Back Guarantee!</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggxmOkkahGb_text","label":"ggxmOkkahGb_text","default":"4. Your TSH Test Is Lying To You (Here's What Really Matters)"},{"type":"html","id":"ggmcFEuvl0L_text","label":"ggmcFEuvl0L_text","default":"<p>Your doctor says your TSH is \"perfect\" at 2.5, 3.0, even 4.0...</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Meanwhile, you're pulling cotton candy-like clumps from your head every shower.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Here's the truth doctors won't admit:</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggqbzWyrTWa_text","label":"ggqbzWyrTWa_text","default":"<p><strong>TSH only measures one thing:</strong> How loud your brain is screaming for thyroid hormone.</p><p>It doesn't measure:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><i>How much T3 is actually reaching your hair follicles</i></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><i>How much Reverse T3 is blocking receptors</i></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><i>Whether your follicles can even USE the hormones</i></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><i>Your conversion efficiency from T4 to T3</i></span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg2zB8PybO5_text","label":"gg2zB8PybO5_text","default":"5. Rogaine and Biotin Work On The WRONG Part of The Problem"},{"type":"html","id":"ggg4ICh_Bu3_text","label":"ggg4ICh_Bu3_text","default":"<p>Let's expose why the most popular \"solutions\" are essentially useless for thyroid hair loss:</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggo4ie1xrQd_text","label":"ggo4ie1xrQd_text","default":"<p><strong>Rogaine (Minoxidil):</strong>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Increases blood flow to follicles. But if those follicles are locked shut by Reverse T3, all the blood flow in the world won't help. It's like delivering packages to a house with the door welded shut.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Biotin:</strong> Helps create keratin (hair protein). But your thyroid controls whether follicles can even USE that keratin. Taking biotin with thyroid issues is like buying expensive gas for a car with a broken engine.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Collagen:</strong> Provides building blocks for hair. Again, useless if your follicles are dormant from lack of T3.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggBCs8pi2-4_text","label":"ggBCs8pi2-4_text","default":"6. The \"Thyroid Support\" Industry Is Designed To Keep You Buying, Not Healing"},{"type":"html","id":"gg2v15f5BNU_text","label":"gg2v15f5BNU_text","default":"<p>Here's what the supplement industry doesn't want you to know:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Most \"thyroid support\" formulas are either:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Dangerously unbalanced</strong> (too much iodine causing flare-ups)</